#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you'll build a minimal Node.js tool that authenticates a user with [Atproto OAuth](/guides/auth) and fetches their profile. The entire app fits in a single TypeScript file.\n"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは、[atproto OAuth](/guides/auth)でユーザー認証し、プロフィールを取得する最小構成のNode.jsツールを作成します。アプリ全体は1つのTypeScriptファイルに収まります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is a good starting point for understanding how OAuth works in AT Protocol. For building production web apps, see the full [OAuth with NextJS Tutorial](/guides/oauth-tutorial).\n"
msgstr "これはATプロトコルでOAuthがどう動くかを理解するための良い出発点です。本番向けウェブアプリを作る場合は、完全版の[OAuth with NextJSチュートリアル](/guides/oauth-tutorial)を参照してください。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new project directory and install the [SDK](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@atproto/lex) and other project dependencies:\n"
msgstr "新しいプロジェクトディレクトリを作成し、[SDK](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@atproto/lex)とその他の依存関係をインストールします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"mkdir oauth-cli\n"
"cd oauth-cli\n"
"npm init -y\n"
"npm i -D typescript @types/node @atproto/oauth-client-node @atproto/lex open\n"
"npx tsc --init --target ES2022 --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --types node --strict --esModuleInterop --skipLibCheck --verbatimModuleSyntax false\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"mkdir oauth-cli\n"
"cd oauth-cli\n"
"npm init -y\n"
"npm i -D typescript @types/node @atproto/oauth-client-node @atproto/lex open\n"
"npx tsc --init --target ES2022 --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --types node --strict --esModuleInterop --skipLibCheck --verbatimModuleSyntax false\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "You'll also need the `lex` CLI tool installed globally, and the `app.bsky.actor.profile` Lexicon installed in this project to fetch the user's profile:\n"
msgstr "ユーザーのプロフィールを取得するには、`lex` CLIツールをグローバルにインストールし、このプロジェクトに`app.bsky.actor.profile` Lexiconを導入する必要があります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"npm i -g @atproto/lex\n"
"lex install app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
"lex build\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"npm i -g @atproto/lex\n"
"lex install app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
"lex build\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "This generates TypeScript types for the Lexicon in your project, which you'll use later to read the authenticated user's profile.\n"
msgstr "これによりプロジェクト内にLexicon用のTypeScriptの型が生成され、後で認証済みユーザーのプロフィールを読む際に利用します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new file at `src/index.ts`. This file will contain all of the code for your CLI tool.\n"
msgstr "`src/index.ts`に新しいファイルを作成してください。このファイルにCLIツールのコードをすべて記述します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Start by importing the packages you'll need, and setting up the OAuth client:\n"
msgstr "まず必要なパッケージをインポートし、OAuthクライアントを設定します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"import http from 'node:http'\n"
"import { NodeOAuthClient, buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata } from '@atproto/oauth-client-node'\n"
"import type { NodeSavedSession, NodeSavedState } from '@atproto/oauth-client-node'\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import open from 'open'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"import http from 'node:http'\n"
"import { NodeOAuthClient, buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata } from '@atproto/oauth-client-node'\n"
"import type { NodeSavedSession, NodeSavedState } from '@atproto/oauth-client-node'\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import open from 'open'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:63
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const stateStore = new Map<string, NodeSavedState>()\n"
"const sessionStore = new Map<string, NodeSavedSession>()\n"
msgstr ""
"const stateStore = new Map<string, NodeSavedState>()\n"
"const sessionStore = new Map<string, NodeSavedSession>()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"const oauthClient = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"  clientMetadata: buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"    scope: 'atproto',\n"
"    redirect_uris: ['http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback'],\n"
"  }),\n"
"  stateStore: {\n"
"    async get(key: string) { return stateStore.get(key) },\n"
"    async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) { stateStore.set(key, value) },\n"
"    async del(key: string) { stateStore.delete(key) },\n"
"  },\n"
"  sessionStore: {\n"
"    async get(key: string) { return sessionStore.get(key) },\n"
"    async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) { sessionStore.set(key, value) },\n"
"    async del(key: string) { sessionStore.delete(key) },\n"
"  },\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"const oauthClient = new NodeOAuthClient({\n"
"  clientMetadata: buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata({\n"
"    scope: 'atproto',\n"
"    redirect_uris: ['http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback'],\n"
"  }),\n"
"  stateStore: {\n"
"    async get(key: string) { return stateStore.get(key) },\n"
"    async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedState) { stateStore.set(key, value) },\n"
"    async del(key: string) { stateStore.delete(key) },\n"
"  },\n"
"  sessionStore: {\n"
"    async get(key: string) { return sessionStore.get(key) },\n"
"    async set(key: string, value: NodeSavedSession) { sessionStore.set(key, value) },\n"
"    async del(key: string) { sessionStore.delete(key) },\n"
"  },\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `NodeOAuthClient` manages the OAuth flow. `buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata` configures it for local development using loopback.\n"
msgstr "`NodeOAuthClient`はOAuthフローを管理します。`buildAtprotoLoopbackClientMetadata`はループバックを使ったローカル開発向け設定を行います。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `stateStore` and `sessionStore` are in-memory Maps. The state store holds temporary data during the OAuth handshake; the session store holds the authenticated session keyed by DID. In a production app, you'd use a database for these.\n"
msgstr "`stateStore`と`sessionStore`はメモリ上のMapです。前者はOAuthハンドシェイク中の一時データを保持し、後者はDIDをキーに認証済みセッションを保持します。本番アプリではこれらにデータベースを使います。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:93
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now add the login flow. You'll start a temporary HTTP server to receive the OAuth callback, then open the user's browser to authorize the app:\n"
msgstr "次にログインフローを追加します。OAuthコールバックを受け取る一時HTTPサーバーを起動し、ユーザーのブラウザを開いてアプリ認可を行います。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"async function login(handle: string) {\n"
"  // Start the OAuth flow — this resolves the handle, finds their auth\n"
"  // server (PDS), and returns a URL to redirect the user to\n"
"  const authUrl = await oauthClient.authorize(handle, { scope: 'atproto' })\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"async function login(handle: string) {\n"
"  // OAuthフローを開始：ハンドルを解決し、認可サーバー（PDS）を見つけ、\n"
"  // ユーザーをリダイレクトするURLを返す\n"
"  const authUrl = await oauthClient.authorize(handle, { scope: 'atproto' })\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  // Wait for the callback from the authorization server\n"
"  const params = await new Promise<URLSearchParams>((resolve, reject) => {\n"
"    const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {\n"
"      const url = new URL(req.url!, 'http://127.0.0.1:3000')\n"
"      if (url.pathname === '/callback') {\n"
"        res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': 'text/html' })\n"
"        res.end('<h1>Authorized! You can close this tab.</h1>')\n"
"        resolve(url.searchParams)\n"
"        server.close()\n"
"      }\n"
"    })\n"
"    server.listen(3000, '127.0.0.1', () => {\n"
"      console.log('Listening on http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback for OAuth redirect...')\n"
"      open(authUrl.toString())\n"
"    })\n"
"    server.on('error', reject)\n"
"  })\n"
msgstr ""
"  // 認可サーバーからのコールバックを待つ\n"
"  const params = await new Promise<URLSearchParams>((resolve, reject) => {\n"
"    const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {\n"
"      const url = new URL(req.url!, 'http://127.0.0.1:3000')\n"
"      if (url.pathname === '/callback') {\n"
"        res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': 'text/html' })\n"
"        res.end('<h1>Authorized! You can close this tab.</h1>')\n"
"        resolve(url.searchParams)\n"
"        server.close()\n"
"      }\n"
"    })\n"
"    server.listen(3000, '127.0.0.1', () => {\n"
"      console.log('Listening on http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback for OAuth redirect...')\n"
"      open(authUrl.toString())\n"
"    })\n"
"    server.on('error', reject)\n"
"  })\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:123
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  // Exchange the authorization code for a session\n"
"  const { session } = await oauthClient.callback(params)\n"
"  return session\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"  // 認可コードを交換してセッション取得\n"
"  const { session } = await oauthClient.callback(params)\n"
"  return session\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:130
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. `oauthClient.authorize(handle)` resolves the user's handle, discovers their PDS, and returns an authorization URL.\n"
"2. The `open` package opens that URL in the user's browser, where they'll see a consent screen.\n"
"3. After the user approves, their PDS redirects back to `http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback` with an authorization code.\n"
"4. `oauthClient.callback(params)` exchanges that code for an authenticated session.\n"
msgstr ""
"1. `oauthClient.authorize(handle)`がユーザーのハンドルを解決し、PDSを見つけ、認可URLを返します。\n"
"2. `open`パッケージがそのURLをユーザーのブラウザで開き、同意画面が表示されます。\n"
"3. ユーザーが承認すると、PDSが認可コード付きで`http://127.0.0.1:3000/callback`にリダイレクトします。\n"
"4. `oauthClient.callback(params)`がそのコードを認証済みセッションに交換します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the session in hand, you can create a lex `Client` to interact with the AT Protocol. Add a `main()` function that ties it all together:\n"
msgstr "セッションが取得できたら、ATプロトコルとやり取りするためにlexの`Client`を作成できます。これらをまとめる`main()`関数を追加しましょう。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:142
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```ts\n"
"async function main() {\n"
"  const handle = process.argv[2]\n"
"  if (!handle) {\n"
"    console.error('Usage: npx tsx src/index.ts <your-handle>')\n"
"    process.exit(1)\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"```ts\n"
"async function main() {\n"
"  const handle = process.argv[2]\n"
"  if (!handle) {\n"
"    console.error('Usage: npx tsx src/index.ts <your-handle>')\n"
"    process.exit(1)\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:146
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  console.log(`Logging in as ${handle}...`)\n"
"  const session = await login(handle)\n"
"  console.log(`Logged in! DID: ${session.did}`)\n"
msgstr ""
"  console.log(`Logging in as ${handle}...`)\n"
"  const session = await login(handle)\n"
"  console.log(`Logged in! DID: ${session.did}`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:149
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  // Create a lex Client with the authenticated session\n"
"  const client = new Client(session)\n"
msgstr ""
"  // 認証済みセッションでlex Clientを作成\n"
"  const client = new Client(session)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:154
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  // Fetch the user's profile\n"
"  const profile = await client.get(app.bsky.actor.profile, {\n"
"    repo: session.did,\n"
"  })\n"
msgstr ""
"  // ユーザーのプロフィールを取得\n"
"  const profile = await client.get(app.bsky.actor.profile, {\n"
"    repo: session.did,\n"
"  })\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:161
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  console.log('\\nProfile:')\n"
"  console.log(`  Handle: ${handle}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  DID: ${session.did}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  Display name: ${profile.value?.displayName ?? '(not set)'}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  Description: ${profile.value?.description ?? '(not set)'}`)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"  console.log('\\nProfile:')\n"
"  console.log(`  Handle: ${handle}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  DID: ${session.did}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  Display name: ${profile.value?.displayName ?? '(not set)'}`)\n"
"  console.log(`  Description: ${profile.value?.description ?? '(not set)'}`)\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/oauth-cli-tutorial/en.mdx:167
